# GitHub has no highlighter for Meadow yet: Linguist adds a language only once
# it is in wide use across GitHub. Until then `.mw` files borrow Haskell's,
# the nearest there is -- the same `--` comments, `data`, `->` and `=>`, and
# `[a]` types -- though `fun` and `match ... with` are not keywords to it.
#
# `linguist-detectable=false` keeps them out of the language bar, which would
# otherwise call this a Haskell repository.
*.mw linguist-language=Haskell linguist-detectable=false
